    {
      "ja": "• パーツの差し替えでジャケットとエプロンの着脱が可能。",
      "en": "• Jacket and apron can be attached and detached by replacing parts."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• ハンドパーツが左右３種類付属し、キービジュアルでも印象的な髪をいじるポーズも再現できる。",
      "en": "• Three types of hand parts, left and right, are included, allowing you to recreate the pose of playing with her hair, which is impressive in the key visual."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 表情パーツは３種類付属し、タンポ印刷のほか選択式の水転写式デカールによりバリエーションを楽しめる。",
      "en": "• Three types of expression parts are included, and you can enjoy variations with tampo printing and selectable water transfer decals."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• ディスプレイの自由度を向上させるプラモデルオリジナルのジョイントパーツや台座が付属。",
      "en": "• Comes with plastic model original joint parts and pedestal to improve display flexibility."
